## Player Model

```python
@dataclass
class Player:
    player_id: str
    name: str
    position: str  # "C", "1B", "2B", "3B", "SS", "OF", "DH", "SP", "RP", "P"
    team: str
    age: Optional[int]
    # Batting: projected_home_runs, projected_obp, projected_runs, projected_rbi, projected_stolen_bases
    # Pitching: projected_wins, projected_quality_starts, projected_strikeouts, projected_era, projected_whip, projected_saves, projected_holds
    adp: Optional[float]  # Average Draft Position
    drafted: bool
    drafted_by_team: Optional[str]
```

